2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Blind\040Calibration\040of\040Timing\040Skew\040in\040Time\055Interleaved\040Analog\055to\055Digital\040Converters)
/Author (V\056\040Divi\054\040Gregory\040W\056\040Wornell)
/Subject (The\040performance\040of\040time\055interleaved\040analog\055to\055digital\040converters\040is\040often\040significantly\040degraded\040by\040timing\040mismatch\040errors\056\040We\040develop\040methods\040for\040performing\040blind\040calibration\040of\040such\040converters\054\040i\056e\056\054\040for\040estimating\040the\040unknown\040time\055skew\040parameters\040and\040for\040performing\040signal\040reconstruction\040from\040these\040estimates\056\040The\040methods\040are\040low\040in\040complexity\040and\040allow\040for\040accurate\040calibration\040in\040systems\040with\040large\040numbers\040of\040converters\054\040provided\040that\040the\040skews\040are\040sufficiently\040small\040in\040magnitude\056\040We\040also\040present\040modifications\040to\040calibrate\040gain\040mismatch\040as\040well\040as\040adaptive\040sequential\040methods\040of\040implementation\056\040Performance\040and\040complexity\040analysis\040is\040provided\040to\040support\040the\040viability\040of\040the\040methods\056)
/Keywords (19\040May\0402009\054\040IEEE\040Journal\040of\040Selected\040Topics\040in\040Signal\040Processing\054\040Converters\054\040Adaptive\040filter\054\040Massachusetts\040Institute\040of\040Technology)
>>
endobj
